      457.62,
      295.23,
      532.38
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land called \u2018Halwathurawatta\u2019 in extent ofabout 1.234 Hectares depicted as Lot \u2018A\u2019 in the Advance TracingNo. KA/BLT/01/208 and dated 28.05.2001, prepared by theSurveyor-General, situated in the Village of Halwathura in the MinorDivision of Gangaboda Pattuwa in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Divisionof Bulathsinhala in Kalutara District in Western Province and boundedas follows:",
